<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span><span id="A5.T6.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Matched SFT-vs.-GRPO comparison on multilingual MATH500.</span>
All values are percentages. All models use Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct as the backbone. SFT and GRPO are trained on the same 1K English MATH examples and evaluated under the same multilingual MATH500 protocol. Low-res. denotes average accuracy over <em id="A5.T6.8" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">bn</em>, <em id="A5.T6.9" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">sw</em>, and <em id="A5.T6.10" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">te</em>; Off-tgt. denotes the off-target language rate.</figcaption>
