</section>
<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Absolute-Transfer Metrics under Parallel Training</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Since MTI measures relative transfer efficiency rather than absolute multilingual reasoning ability, we additionally report several absolute-transfer metrics for the Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct parallel-training experiments. Specifically, we compute non-English average accuracy, which excludes English from the language average; the English–non-English gap, which measures how far non-English performance lags behind English; and low-resource average accuracy over <em id="A5.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">bn</em>, <em id="A5.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">sw</em>, and <em id="A5.SS2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">te</em>. MTI is retained only as an auxiliary diagnostic of relative transfer efficiency.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.T7" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A5.T7.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A5.T7.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A5.T7.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;"><span id="A5.T7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Setting</span></th>
<th id="A5.T7.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;"><span id="A5.T7.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">En</span></th>
<th id="A5.T7.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;"><span id="A5.T7.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Non-En</span></th>
<th id="A5.T7.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;"><span id="A5.T7.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Gap</span></th>
<th id="A5.T7.2.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;"><span id="A5.T7.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Low-res.</span></th>
<th id="A5.T7.2.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;"><span id="A5.T7.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MTI</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A5.T7.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A5.T7.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;">English-only</th>
<td id="A5.T7.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;">79.20</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;">51.74</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;">27.46</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;">29.53</td>
