<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 16: </span><span id="A6.T16.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">The Performance of Base Models with Different Template Settings.</span> Accuracy (%) and Off-target rate (%) across languages for different template settings on multilingual MATH500 benchmark.</figcaption>
