<section id="A6.SS2.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">F.2.3 </span>Detailed Results for Open-source Models</h4>

<div id="A6.SS2.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS2.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A7.T25" title="Table 25 ‣ Appendix G Dataset License ‣ How Well Does Mathematical Reasoning Transfer Across Languages in English-Centric LLMs?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">25</span></a> provides the full transfer, accuracy, and off-target results for the open-source models in the observational study. These tables complement Figure <a href="#S2.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ Benchmarks. ‣ 2.1 Setup ‣ 2 Observational Study ‣ How Well Does Mathematical Reasoning Transfer Across Languages in English-Centric LLMs?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> in the main text by showing the benchmark-level and language-level variation behind the averaged results.</p>
</div>
