Models are trained on English data with parallel Russian data.
<math id="A6.T18.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\lambda_{1},\lambda_{2},\lambda_{3})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\lambda_{1},\lambda_{2},\lambda_{3})</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the weights of the three reward
components.
