<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 19: </span><span id="A6.T19.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Impact of model initialization on cross-lingual transfer.</span>
All models are initialized from Qwen2.5-7B variants and trained with GRPO
on the same English data. We report average accuracy (%) across languages
on MATH500 (M500), AIME24 (A24), AIME25 (A25), and GPQA-Diamond (GPQA),
together with overall average accuracy, off-target rate (%), and MTI.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A6.SS3.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">F.3.3 </span>Detailed Results for Model Family</h4>

<div id="A6.SS3.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS3.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A6.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ F.3.3 Detailed Results for Model Family ‣ F.3 Controlled Comparative Study ‣ Appendix F Detailed Results and Analysis ‣ How Well Does Mathematical Reasoning Transfer Across Languages in English-Centric LLMs?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> provides the full benchmark-level results for the model family comparison between Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct and Llama3.1-8B-Instruct. In both families, English-only GRPO improves performance across languages, but the relative gains differ substantially. As discussed in the main text, this comparison should be interpreted as a controlled comparison under matched post-training settings rather than as a pure estimate of family effects, since tokenization, pretraining data, and architecture remain entangled.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A6.F9" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="A6.F9.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.02272v2/x1.svg" id="A6.F9.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:452/96;" width="452" height="96"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>MATH500</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="A6.F9.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.02272v2/impact_of_different_initial_model_qwen_vs_llama_on_aime24_v2.svg" id="A6.F9.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:452/96;" width="452" height="96"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span>AIME24</figcaption>
