<p id="A6.SS4.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A6.T22" title="Table 22 ‣ F.4.1 Detailed Results of Parallel Training ‣ F.4 Parallel Training Results ‣ Appendix F Detailed Results and Analysis ‣ How Well Does Mathematical Reasoning Transfer Across Languages in English-Centric LLMs?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a> reports the full accuracy results across languages for different numbers of training languages. These tables complement Figure <a href="#S3.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ 3.4 Model Size ‣ 3 Controlled Comparative Study ‣ How Well Does Mathematical Reasoning Transfer Across Languages in English-Centric LLMs?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> in the main text by providing the full language-level breakdown behind the averaged trends.</p>
</div>
